  "question": {
    "text": "The distance of the origin from the centroid of the triangle whose two sides have the equations&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and whose&nbsp;orthocenter is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is:",
    "image": null
  },
