  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, altitude from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;which is perpendicular to line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and which passes through&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,</p><p>Now intersection of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;will give point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Similarly, altitude from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>C</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Centroid of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#9651;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi></math>&nbsp;is origin.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
